\begin{itemize}
    \item A) $\frac{1}{4}$
    \item B) $\frac{1}{10}$
    \item C) $\frac{7}{15}$
    \item D) $\boxed{\frac{8}{15}}$
\end{itemize}

\textbf{Answer:} Option D

A's 1 day's work = $\frac{1}{15}$;

B's 1 day's work = $\frac{1}{20}$;

A's 3 day's work = $\frac{3}{15} = \frac{1}{5}$;

